cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. If you use the derived
  data, cite the data release (data-v1.0.0) and the sources in its README.
type: software
title: "Soundscape Data Pipeline: El Silencio Nature Reserve"
abstract: >-
  Data pipeline that turns one-minute field recordings from El Silencio
  Nature Reserve (Colombia) into acoustic indices, quality flags and BirdNET
  bird detections, orchestrated with Airflow and modelled with dbt.
authors:
  - family-names: Martínez
    given-names: Rodrigo
